good to you.

344
16:13.430 --> 16:14.910
I would never harm you.

345
16:18.340 --> 16:19.950
And also...

346
16:21.710 --> 16:22.640
Well...

347
17:14.550 --> 17:16.109
Geng Jian committed suicide.

348
17:16.109 --> 17:17.390
The police station will reopen the investigation

349
17:17.390 --> 17:18.390
into my mom's case.

350
17:18.390 --> 17:19.630
Geng Jian is dead?

351
17:21.760 --> 17:22.349
Such a big thing happened.

352
17:22.349 --> 17:23.040
Why didn't you

353
17:23.040 --> 17:24.099
tell me in advance?

354
17:25.480 --> 17:26.750
It was too dangerous.

355
17:27.000 --> 17:28.720
Fortunately, the police arrived in time.

356
17:28.720 --> 17:30.110
What you two did...

357
17:30.110 --> 17:31.310
What if Geng Jian got desperate

358
17:31.310 --> 17:32.280
and did something crazy?

359
17:32.280 --> 17:33.150
If...

360
17:33.150 --> 17:34.000
If something happened to you,

361
17:34.000 --> 17:34.790
what...

362
17:35.200 --> 17:36.350
What would I do?

363
17:37.000 --> 17:37.790
Xiaoyun.

364
17:40.280 --> 17:41.110
Wait.

365
17:42.310 --> 17:43.110
Geng Jian...

366
17:44.390 --> 17:46.630
I really didn't expect it to be Geng Jian.

367
17:46.630 --> 17:47.720
He usually said

368
17:47.830 --> 17:48.920
we were one.

369
17:49.150 --> 17:49.870
How could he do such

370
17:49.870 --> 17:50.960
a heartless thing?

371
17:51.200 --> 17:52.260
Back then, Wan Yang

372
17:52.590 --> 17:53.630
hid the evidence.

373
17:54.000 --> 17:55.260
Otherwise, the police

374
17:57.240 --> 17:59.300
would have caught Geng Jian long ago.

375
18:01.000 --> 18:02.310
But how did Shan

376
18:03.390 --> 18:05.480
find Geng Jian all by himself this time?

377
18:05.480 --> 18:06.870
I want to leave here.

378
18:10.110 --> 18:10.920
Indeed.

379
18:11.040 --> 18:12.210
You've suffered...

380
18:12.760 --> 18:13.760
such a big shock.

381
18:13.830 --> 18:14.550
It's understandable.

382
18:14.550 --> 18:16.040
How about I book a ticket for you?

383
18:16.040 --> 18:17.790
You can go out and relax.

384
18:17.870 --> 18:19.280
Take your time, okay?

385
18:21.590 --> 18:22.920
I want to leave Wugang.

386
18:23.350 --> 18:24.590
As long as I'm here,

387
18:24.960 --> 18:26.760
I'll think of Chen Fu's death,

388
18:27.680 --> 18:29.010
Zhang Wenying's death,

389
18:30.110 --> 18:31.630
and now Geng Jian's death.

390
18:32.830 --> 18:34.230
I don't want to stay here.

391
18:34.280 --> 18:35.680
Take me with you,

392
18:35.960 --> 18:37.040
okay, Qi Mo?

393
18:42.480 --> 18:43.310
Xiaoyun.

394
18:46.110 --> 18:47.040
I can totally understand

395
18:47.040 --> 18:48.830
how you feel right now.

396
18:49.960 --> 18:51.630
But asking me to go with you?

397
18:53.960 --> 18:54.960
Let's not joke about this.

398
18:54.960 --> 18:56.760
I really can't leave.

399
18:57.070 --> 18:59.040
I wanted to leave here 3 years ago.

400
19:00.280 --> 19:01.830
I only stayed because you said

401
19:01.830 --> 19:03.280
you'd help me investigate the cause

402
19:03.280 --> 19:04.760
of my biological parents' death.

403
19:04.760 --> 19:06.480
But have you investigated it over the past 3 years?

404
19:06.480 --> 19:07.180
Every day, all you care about

405
19:07.180 --> 19:08.070
is the company!

406
19:08.070 --> 19:09.530
Have you investigated it?

407
19:11.040 --> 19:12.260
Now the bidding for the phase-two project

408
19:12.260 --> 19:13.280
has failed.

409
19:13.480 --> 19:14.710
The company still has a pile of debts

410
19:14.710 --> 19:15.440
waiting to be handled.

411
19:15.440 --> 19:16.070
What else is there

412
19:16.070 --> 19:17.480
worth holding onto,

413
19:17.480 --> 19:18.200
Qi Mo?

414
19:18.830 --> 19:21.310
-No, well… -Let's go. Take me away, okay?

415
19:21.310 --> 19:22.640
Xiaoyun, don't rush.

416
19:23.440 --> 19:24.350
Don't rush.

417
19:24.390 --> 19:24.930
Yes,

418
19:24.960 --> 19:26.440
the bidding has failed now.

419
19:26.440 --> 19:27.310
But right now,

420
19:28.040 --> 19:29.330
it's a huge mess.

421
19:29.360 --> 19:31.150
I can't just leave like that.

422
19:31.150 --> 19:33.280
Your career is more important than me.

423
19:34.280 --> 19:35.120
You...

424
19:35.840 --> 19:36.670
Why bring up

425
19:36.670 --> 19:37.360
who's more important?

426
19:37.360 --> 19:38.600
That's not the case.

427
19:38.910 --> 19:39.630
Xiaoyun, look.

428
19:39.630 --> 19:40.910
I am the chairman of this enterprise,

429
19:40.910 --> 19:41.630
right?

430
19:42.430 --> 19:43.280
There are still a lot of people

431
19:43.280 --> 19:44.190
depending on me for a living.

432
19:44.190 --> 19:45.000
If I leave,

433
19:45.040 --> 19:46.120
what will happen to the employees?

434
19:46.120 --> 19:47.150
-We can't just think about— -You don't want to give up

435
19:47.150 --> 19:48.710
the power in your hands.

436
19:48.910 --> 19:50.520
You're being a bit unreasonable.

437
19:50.520 --> 19:52.520
What does this have to do with power?

438
19:52.670 --> 19:53.320
Yes,

439
19:53.840 --> 19:55.150
the bidding for the phase-two project failed,

440
19:55.150 --> 19:57.040
but it won't affect your life,

441
19:57.040 --> 19:57.800
alright?

442
19:57.910 --> 19:59.710
Do I care about this kind of life?

443
20:00.360 --> 20:00.910
Am I a woman

444
20:00.910 --> 20:02.390
who cares about material things?

445
20:02.390 --> 20:03.040
If I were,

446
20:03.040 --> 20:03.430
why would I have married you

447
20:03.430 --> 20:04.800
3 years ago?

448
20:04.800 --> 20:06.000
-Wasn't it because you liked me? -Back then,

449
20:06.000 --> 20:06.840
you had nothing.

450
20:06.840 --> 20:07.950
I just want to leave here.

451
20:07.950 --> 20:09.600
Why can't we?

452
20:09.600 --> 20:11.630
-Let's find another place to live again. -We can't leave now, okay?

453
20:11.630 --> 20:13.020
Let's start over.

454
20:13.040 --> 20:14.840
I can endure any hardship.

455
20:14.840 --> 20:16.350
-I can't leave now, okay? -Let's find a place.

456
20:16.350 --> 20:17.560
-Hello. -We could run a street stall,

457
20:17.560 --> 20:19.000
-selling socks and insoles. -Let's not talk about money, okay?

458
20:19.000 --> 20:20.230
-We could also open a shop. -I'll call you later.

459
20:20.230 --> 20:21.320
Anything is fine, okay?

460
20:21.320 --> 20:22.560
-Xiaoyun, it's not about leaving or not. -Qi Mo, I just…

461
20:22.560 --> 20:23.470
-I really… You... -I want to leave.

462
20:23.470 --> 20:24.710
-I can't. -I don't want to stay here anymore.

463
20:24.710 --> 20:26.670
-I want a peaceful life. -Can't you calm down?

464
20:26.670 --> 20:28.120
-Nothing is impossible. -I don't like

465
20:28.120 --> 20:29.150
this kind of life anymore.

466
20:29.150 --> 20:30.320
I really can't take it anymore.

467
20:30.320 --> 20:31.230
-When I'm here... -Hello.

468
20:31.230 --> 20:32.670
-All I think about is... -I'm busy right now!

469
20:32.670 --> 20:33.800
-I'll call you back later! -I beg you!

470
20:33.800 --> 20:36.260
-Can we stop arguing? -Let's get out of here!

471
20:52.190 --> 20:53.320
Let's get a divorce.

472
21:04.480 --> 21:06.770
What does this have to do with divorce?

473
21:14.500 --> 21:19.030
[Cultivate virtue and uphold what is right]

474
21:14.680 --> 21:15.420
What?

475
21:16.760 --> 21:17.950
Geng Jian is dead?

476
21:25.040 --> 21:26.360
Okay, I got it.

477
22:13.080 --> 22:15.870
[Cultivate virtue and uphold what is right]

478
22:35.150 --> 22:38.620
[Cultivate virtue and uphold]

479
22:43.670 --> 22:46.760
[10 Criteria for Good Health]

480
22:57.630 --> 22:58.470
Xiaoyun.

481
23:03.190 --> 23:04.000
Xiaoyun?

482
23:15.470 --> 23:16.280
Xiaoyun?

483
24:15.700 --> 24:16.510
Shan.

484
24:18.150 --> 24:20.010
Ying told you everything, right?

485
24:30.980 --> 24:32.070
Xiaoyun,

486
24:32.550 --> 24:34.790
isn't this the same as running away from home?

487
24:34.790 --> 24:35.590
You...

488
24:35.610 --> 24:37.550
What are you doing here?

489
24:38.680 --> 24:39.920
Can't I come here?

490
24:41.370 --> 24:42.000
This is the place

491
24:42.000 --> 24:43.390
where I grew up.

492
24:43.700 --> 24:44.830
I'm saying goodbye to my past.

493
24:44.830 --> 24:45.960
Is that not allowed?

494
24:46.230 --> 24:47.470
Y-Y-Yes.

495
24:47.650 --> 24:48.970
Yes, you can. Xiaoyun, Xiaoyun.

496
24:48.970 --> 24:50.930
Wait, you should tell me where you want to go.

497
24:50.930 --> 24:52.530
I didn't say you couldn't come here.

498
24:52.530 --> 24:53.770
I'll go wherever you want to go.

499
24:53.770 --> 24:54.640
Isn't that enough?

500
24:54.640 --> 24:55.670
You'll go with me?

501
24:55.800 --> 24:56.930
What did you say yesterday?

502
24:56.930 --> 24:57.360
No.

503
24:57.360 --> 24:58.360
You brought it up too suddenly yesterday.

504
24:58.360 --> 24:59.450
I didn't have time to process it.

505
24:59.450 --> 25:00.930
I've processed it now.

506
25:00.930 --> 25:02.450
My career isn't important.

507
25:02.450 --> 25:03.360
You are the most important.

508
25:03.360 --> 25:05.360
-Tell me where you want to go. -Qi Mo.

509
25:05.770 --> 25:07.770
You're only saying you'll go with me

510
25:08.010 --> 25:09.670
because I asked for a divorce.

511
25:10.210 --> 25:11.930
How can you expect me to believe you?

512
25:11.930 --> 25:12.400
No,

513
25:12.400 --> 25:13.640
this has nothing to do with divorce, right?

514
25:13.640 --> 25:14.320
Xiaoyun.

515
25:14.400 --> 25:15.600
Xiaoyun, Xiaoyun!

516
25:15.770 --> 25:16.970
D-Don't lock the door.

517
25:16.970 --> 25:18.250
Xiaoyun, Xiaoyun.

518
25:18.450 --> 25:20.510
I need to know the reason.

519
25:20.690 --> 25:21.490
Xiaoyun.

520
25:21.730 --> 25:23.140
I'm begging you, okay?

521
25:24.320 --> 25:25.600
Mom and Dad are here.

522
25:25.600 --> 25:26.500
In front of Mom and Dad,

523
25:26.500 --> 25:28.300
I'm kneeling down for you, okay?

524
25:28.320 --> 25:29.360
I'm on both knees.

525
25:29.360 --> 25:29.970
Look at me.

526
25:29.970 --> 25:31.320
See if I'm kneeling here.

527
25:31.320 --> 25:32.010
Wait,

528
25:32.010 --> 25:34.050
why do you want to divorce me?

529
25:34.640 --> 25:35.640
It's been 3 years.

530
25:36.320 --> 25:37.130
There hasn't been a single day

531
25:37.130 --> 25:38.930
when I treated you badly, right?

532
25:39.250 --> 25:40.850
Before we got married, I said

533
25:40.960 --> 25:41.960
I wouldn't let you share

534
25:41.960 --> 25:43.080
any of the housework.

535
25:43.080 --> 25:44.800
I think I've done a good job.

536
25:45.280 --> 25:46.240
If you feel tired from work,

537
25:46.240 --> 25:47.240
you don't have to work.

538
25:47.240 --> 25:48.970
You can just stay home and rest.

539
26:02.110 --> 26:02.960
Shan.

540
26:05.000 --> 26:06.660
Help me persuade your sister.

541
26:07.350 --> 26:08.680
Put in a good word for me.

542
26:09.800 --> 26:11.860
Eat some noodles and rest for a while.

543
26:14.000 --> 26:15.480
Look at the time,

544
26:15.480 --> 26:17.340
and you're still eating noodles?

545
26:19.960 --> 26:21.090
Wait a minute, Shan.

546
26:22.280 --> 26:23.810
I suddenly remembered something.

547
26:23.810 --> 26:25.280
Ying made up with you so quickly.

548
26:25.280 --> 26:26.140
Could it be that

549
26:27.390 --> 26:28.830
you brainwashed her?

550
26:32.150 --> 26:33.230
Geng Jian killed your mother,

551
26:33.230 --> 26:33.870
so I

552
26:34.340 --> 26:35.670
had to kill your father?

553
26:36.040 --> 26:37.760
I'm not the same kind of person as Geng Jian,

554
26:37.760 --> 26:38.480
Xiaoyun!

555
26:38.760 --> 26:40.630
Don't let Chen Shan

556
26:40.630 --> 26:42.080
brainwash you!

557
26:42.350 --> 26:43.190
Did you tell your sister again

558
26:43.190 --> 26:43.800
about what

559
26:43.800 --> 26:44.720
Ma Yiming said?

560
26:44.720 --> 26:45.390
Did you?

561
26:48.080 --> 26:48.870
Shan.

562
26:48.870 --> 26:49.390
Shan.

563
26:49.390 --> 26:50.110
Shan.

564
26:51.000 --> 26:51.960
M-Ma Yiming told you

565
26:51.960 --> 26:52.720
that I went to the valve pit?

566
26:52.720 --> 26:53.150
Let me tell you,

567
26:53.150 --> 26:54.390
I really didn't go to the valve pit.

568
26:54.390 --> 26:56.990
You can't keep telling your sister about this.

569
26:58.280 --> 26:59.040
You're not divorcing me

570
26:59.040 --> 27:00.440
because of this, are you?

571
27:00.910 --> 27:01.710
Xiaoyun?

572
27:03.560 --> 27:04.350
Fine then.

573
27:06.480 --> 27:07.740
Let's take a step back.

574
27:09.320 --> 27:10.150
Ma Yiming told you

575
27:10.150 --> 27:11.800
that I went to the valve pit, right?

576
27:11.800 --> 27:12.430
Okay.

577
27:13.720 --> 27:15.380
Let's just follow your logic.

578
27:16.390 --> 27:17.650
I went to the valve pit.

579
27:17.960 --> 27:18.820
What could I do?

580
27:19.190 --> 27:21.520
Could I kill someone if I went to the valve pit?

581
27:21.520 --> 27:22.450
Alright, come on.

582
27:22.450 --> 27:23.980
If you have evidence today,

583
27:24.040 --> 27:25.240
call the police

584
27:25.520 --> 27:26.630
and have the police arrest me right now,

585
27:26.630 --> 27:27.190
alright?

586
27:28.430 --> 27:29.390
Is that okay?

587
27:32.430 --> 27:33.410
If you have it,

588
27:33.590 --> 27:34.240
come on.

589
27:35.630 --> 27:36.480
Tell me.

590
27:36.520 --> 27:37.800
I'll call 911 myself

591
27:38.760 --> 27:39.720
and turn myself in,

592
27:39.720 --> 27:40.390
okay?

593
27:45.830 --> 27:47.960
Why is that?

594
27:48.960 --> 27:51.520
Why is that, Xiaoyun?

595
27:51.670 --> 27:53.390
Is it because I won't go with you?

596
27:53.390 --> 27:54.110
Come out now.

597
27:54.110 --> 27:54.800
Wherever you want to go,

598
27:54.800 --> 27:56.060
I'll go with you, okay?

599
27:56.080 --> 27:57.190
I'll go with you tomorrow.

600
27:57.190 --> 27:58.250
Isn't that enough?

601
28:05.720 --> 28:07.080
Okay, fine.

602
28:08.390 --> 28:09.110
Shan.

603
28:11.080 --> 28:11.800
Chen Shan.

604
28:12.320 --> 28:14.070
Help me pass a message to Ying.

605
28:14.560 --> 28:15.350
I won't get

606
28:16.150 --> 28:17.000
a divorce.

607
28:17.720 --> 28:18.560
I won't get one even if I die!

608
28:18.560 --> 28:20.360
I won't get one in this lifetime!

609
28:20.430 --> 28:21.760
Xiaoyun wants a divorce.

610
28:21.760 --> 28:22.630
Go ahead and sue me.

611
28:22.630 --> 28:23.560
Take it to court!

612
28:49.780 --> 28:50.680
Can't sleep?

613
28:57.190 --> 28:58.040
I know.

614
28:59.280 --> 28:59.830
After all, you two

615
28:59.830 --> 29:01.360
lived together for 3 years.

616
29:04.360 --> 29:06.420
You must still have feelings for him.

617
29:08.800 --> 29:10.110
Doing this to you

618
29:11.080 --> 29:12.630
seems a bit too cruel.

619
29:21.800 --> 29:23.590
Sometimes I actually wonder,

620
29:25.150 --> 29:26.520
if I hadn't come back,

621
29:28.870 --> 29:30.520
would everything have

622
29:32.620 --> 29:34.010
gone on normally?

623
29:35.480 --> 29:37.150
Would you have been able to live

624
29:37.150 --> 29:39.480
a happy and joyful life?

625
29:44.590 --> 29:46.100
Look at those stars.

626
29:47.530 --> 29:49.860
They are occasionally covered by clouds.

627
29:50.140 --> 29:51.130
But eventually,

628
29:52.720 --> 29:53.670
the stars will still

629
29:53.670 --> 29:54.960
shine their light.

630
29:59.020 --> 30:00.380
Superficial happiness

631
30:01.830 --> 30:03.560
is like clouds you can't catch.

632
30:05.990 --> 30:08.520
Even if they occasionally cover everything,

633
30:09.650 --> 30:11.110
they can't hide the truth.

634
30:13.410 --> 30:14.210
I once said

635
30:16.280 --> 30:19.340
I'd rather face the truth, however painful it may be...

636
30:19.610 --> 30:22.050
Than be trapped in an illusory dream.

637
30:26.480 --> 30:27.610
I understand, Ying.

638
30:29.040 --> 30:29.960
In that case,

639
30:31.050 --> 30:32.670
we'll fight Qi Mo to the end.

640
30:32.960 --> 30:34.870
We'll fight a protracted war with him.

641
30:34.870 --> 30:35.940
I've already talked

642
30:35.940 --> 30:37.280
to those suppliers.

643
30:40.080 --> 30:42.110
Qi Mo is very persuasive.

644
30:42.640 --> 30:43.950
I'm afraid even so,

645
30:44.860 --> 30:46.390
we can't do anything to him.

646
30:47.020 --> 30:48.350
This time is different.

647
30:49.320 --> 30:50.670
At the bidding meeting,

648
30:51.350 --> 30:52.190
from putting the accounts

649
30:52.190 --> 30:53.830
in front of Director Xia,

650
30:54.480 --> 30:56.000
this is no longer a problem

651
30:56.000 --> 30:57.730
that can be solved internally.

652
31:02.970 --> 31:07.760
[Wugang Petrochemical Plant]

653
31:03.080 --> 31:05.040
I'll take out my personal assets

654
31:05.150 --> 31:06.630
to make up for your overdue interest

655
31:06.630 --> 31:07.520
first.

656
31:08.040 --> 31:09.150
Yes, don't worry.

657
31:09.480 --> 31:11.700
My ship is big and hard to turn around.

658
31:11.870 --> 31:13.480
Please give us more time.

659
31:14.440 --> 31:15.350
Yes, yes.

660
31:14.860 --> 31:17.180
[Quality Management Department]

661
31:20.160 --> 31:20.510
[Quality Management Department]

662
31:20.870 --> 31:21.930
What are you doing?

663
31:24.150 --> 31:24.960
Go, go, go.

664
31:34.390 --> 31:35.190
Well...

665
31:35.540 --> 31:36.740
Director Xia, you...

666
31:37.460 --> 31:38.480
What are you here for?

667
31:38.480 --> 31:39.110
Qi Mo,

668
31:39.720 --> 31:41.630
I represent the head office and the bureau

669
31:41.630 --> 31:42.960
to announce a decision.

670
31:43.830 --> 31:45.320
You led the enterprise reform back then

671
31:45.320 --> 31:46.040
and made contributions,

672
31:46.040 --> 31:47.150
and the organization remembers that.

673
31:47.150 --> 31:48.150
But in the past 2 years,

674
31:48.150 --> 31:49.830
in major business decisions,

675
31:49.830 --> 31:51.000
you were eager for quick success,

676
31:51.000 --> 31:52.590
