733
33:41.830 --> 33:42.960
Let's welcome them.

734
33:52.040 --> 33:54.470
We are all old acquaintances, right?

735
33:54.720 --> 33:55.240
Yes.

736
33:55.240 --> 33:55.970
-Yes. -Yes.

737
33:56.110 --> 33:56.670
Come,

738
33:57.110 --> 33:59.370
