742
34:04.140 --> 34:05.110
Hello, everyone.

743
34:05.110 --> 34:07.800
I am the head of Fu Wenshan Pipeline Engineering

744
34:07.800 --> 34:09.750
Technology Co., Ltd.,

745
34:09.840 --> 34:10.520
Chen Shan.

746
34:17.440 --> 34:17.880
I am—

747
34:17.880 --> 34:18.710
Accountant Peng.

748
34:18.710 --> 34:19.630
Since we know each other so well,

749
34:19.630 --> 34:21.630
