754
34:32.199 --> 34:33.120
Chen Ying.

755
34:36.050 --> 34:38.889
I'm Sun Jie from Fuwenshan Supply Center.

756
34:42.610 --> 34:45.540
I'm He Jianchuan, Captain of the Construction Team.

757
34:46.050 --> 34:48.639
I'm Feng Jian from the Fuwenshan Design Department.

758
34:48.639 --> 34:50.590
I'm Sun Qianqian from the Fuwenshan Administration Department.

759
34:50.590 --> 34:52.600
I'm Hu, Secretary to the Chairman of Fuwenshan.

760
34:52.600 --> 34:55.000
