770
35:11.000 --> 35:11.590
Many of you

771
35:11.590 --> 35:13.080
watched me grow up.

772
35:13.200 --> 35:15.040
Now that we are working together,

773
35:15.040 --> 35:16.310
I hope you can

774
35:16.310 --> 35:18.000
