775
35:18.150 --> 35:20.280
We will definitely listen carefully.

776
35:20.320 --> 35:21.560
Most importantly,

777
35:22.630 --> 35:24.360
I hope you can take good care of us.

778
35:24.360 --> 35:25.750
Let's make progress together.

779
35:25.750 --> 35:26.270
Great!

780
35:26.270 --> 35:28.630
-Great! -Great!

781
35:38.630 --> 35:39.960
The boxes you asked for.

782
35:41.520 --> 35:42.310
Have a seat.

783
35:45.880 --> 35:47.880
How many years have you been with me?

784
35:49.040 --> 35:49.880
Three years.

785
35:52.790 --> 35:53.590
Do you think

786
35:55.670 --> 35:57.470
I'm a good person or a bad person?

787
36:05.040 --> 36:05.920
During the reform of state-owned enterprises,

788
36:05.920 --> 36:07.580
I was definitely a bad person.

789
36:08.440 --> 36:09.150
After all, the plant

790
36:09.150 --> 36:10.480
