791
36:11.270 --> 36:12.800
Otherwise, I wouldn't have

792
36:13.150 --> 36:15.150
gotten a flat tire every single day.

793
36:15.710 --> 36:16.520
But

794
36:17.920 --> 36:19.320
I think I'm a good person.

795
36:20.590 --> 36:21.710
The salaries of those who stayed

796
36:21.710 --> 36:22.790
