797
36:22.790 --> 36:24.450
They live better than before.

798
36:25.320 --> 36:26.110
Also,

799
36:27.080 --> 36:28.140
I'm different from

800
36:29.440 --> 36:32.270
Wan Yang and Geng Jian

801
36:32.290 --> 36:33.490
