802
36:33.810 --> 36:34.890
Compared to them,

803
36:38.590 --> 36:40.250
I'm definitely a good person.

804
36:41.520 --> 36:44.520
I have already submitted my resignation to the plant.

805
36:46.110 --> 36:47.670
Help me pack all the things there

806
36:47.670 --> 36:48.670
