807
36:58.840 --> 37:00.440
You are no longer Manager Qi.

808
37:01.150 --> 37:03.010
And I am no longer your secretary.

809
37:47.040 --> 37:48.500
The opponent is defeated.

810
37:49.310 --> 37:50.510
And the enemy is dead.

811
37:51.520 --> 37:52.230
Why do you seem

812
37:52.230 --> 37:53.490
