813
37:55.080 --> 37:55.920
When I watched those

814
37:55.920 --> 37:57.520
martial arts movies as a kid,

815
37:58.840 --> 38:00.440
seeing the bad guys defeated

816
38:02.040 --> 38:03.670
made me feel really good.

817
38:05.400 --> 38:06.650
But now I find

818
38:09.270 --> 38:10.480
that this feeling

819
38:12.230 --> 38:14.030
is actually quite complicated.

820
38:16.520 --> 38:17.710
And a bit sad.

821
38:20.640 --> 38:22.240
[Premium Cotton Socks] [Blowout Sale]

822
38:37.110 --> 38:39.730
Comrade, do you want to buy socks?

823
38:49.930 --> 38:51.430
What is he doing?

824
39:06.840 --> 39:07.630
Here, Ying.

825
39:13.750 --> 39:14.950
Thinking about Qi Mo?

826
39:18.230 --> 39:19.590
Such a proud person,

827
39:20.600 --> 39:23.600
