831
39:32.830 --> 39:34.760
which is indeed quite lamentable.

832
39:36.440 --> 39:37.230
But Ying,

833
39:38.230 --> 39:39.040
if we really

834
39:39.040 --> 39:40.110
let him continue

835
39:40.310 --> 39:41.710
