836
39:41.710 --> 39:42.790
the entire Wugang Petrochemical

837
39:42.790 --> 39:44.320
will be dragged down by him.

838
39:44.440 --> 39:45.190
All the employees

839
39:45.190 --> 39:46.850
will be doomed along with him.

840
39:50.670 --> 39:52.710
For the future of Wugang Petrochemical,

841
39:52.710 --> 39:53.590
he is indeed no longer suitable

842
39:53.590 --> 39:54.790
to be the leader.

843
39:57.920 --> 39:58.630
But no matter what

844
39:58.630 --> 40:00.040
mistakes he makes,

845
40:01.440 --> 40:02.560
his kindness to me over the years

846
40:02.560 --> 40:03.480
is real.

847
40:06.360 --> 40:08.420
That kind of goodness can't be faked.

848
40:09.230 --> 40:10.400
It's hard for me

849
40:11.310 --> 40:13.170
to associate him with a murderer.

850
40:15.110 --> 40:16.770
But I just can't figure it out.

851
40:18.960 --> 40:20.400
If he is not the murderer,

852
40:21.400 --> 40:22.480
since it's come to this,

853
40:22.480 --> 40:23.790
why won't he tell the truth?

854
40:23.790 --> 40:25.400
What exactly is he hiding?

855
40:33.360 --> 40:34.360
Brother, sister,

856
40:34.360 --> 40:36.160
here are the dishes you ordered.

857
40:36.790 --> 40:38.720
Helping adults at such a young age.

858
40:47.370 --> 40:49.170
[Ying]

859
40:47.690 --> 40:49.490
I know my daughter is qualified,

860
40:49.560 --> 40:50.960
but sometimes you have to grease

861
40:50.960 --> 40:51.840
the right palms.

862
40:51.840 --> 40:53.360
Please pass this

863
40:53.630 --> 40:55.030
to Department Chief Sun.

864
40:56.630 --> 40:57.440
Alright.

865
40:59.750 --> 41:01.130
[Ying]

866
41:04.630 --> 41:06.630
Where did this gold longevity lock come from?

867
41:06.630 --> 41:08.160
My dad gave it to me.

868
41:10.710 --> 41:11.440
Dad,

869
41:11.440 --> 41:13.700
