870
41:14.480 --> 41:15.810
Department Chief Wang.

871
41:16.980 --> 41:18.060
Why are you here?

872
41:19.000 --> 41:20.200
Go find your grandma.

873
41:24.150 --> 41:25.920
Where did that gold longevity lock come from?

874
41:25.920 --> 41:27.880
What does it matter where it came from?

875
41:27.880 --> 41:28.520
I bought my child

876
41:28.520 --> 41:29.400
