880
41:32.790 --> 41:34.750
It has the character "Ying" engraved on the back.

881
41:34.750 --> 41:36.880
That belongs to my mom, Zhang Wenying.

882
41:37.110 --> 41:38.440
So what if it's engraved?

883
41:38.440 --> 41:39.560
Does an engraving make it yours?

884
41:39.560 --> 41:40.420
I could also say

885
41:40.440 --> 41:41.840
