901
42:04.150 --> 42:05.950
you'd better confess honestly.

902
42:07.270 --> 42:08.530
Not going to talk, huh?

903
42:09.110 --> 42:10.560
Explain it at the police station!

904
42:10.560 --> 42:11.140
What are you doing?

905
42:11.140 --> 42:11.920
-What are you doing? -Let's go!

906
42:11.920 --> 42:12.670
I... I picked it up!

907
42:12.670 --> 42:13.670
I picked it up!

908
42:13.700 --> 42:14.700
I picked it up, okay?
